    <modified>2026-10-30T19:25:17Z</modified>
	<content type="text/html" mode="escaped">Author: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.smspower.org:443/forums/profile.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=85&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;TheAssassin&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
	Posted: Fri Oct 30, 2026 7:25 pm (GMT 0)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span class="postbody"&gt;
	Streets of Rage II was my favorite SMS game, I wish it got more recognition. Obviously it can't compare to the 16-bit MD version, but for what it is, the SMS version deserves more than a 68 average!
&lt;br /&gt;

&lt;br /&gt;
On the other hand, Bart vs The Space Mutants is the worst game I ever played on SMS (and probably on any system for that matter). Yet somehow the SMS version gets a 78 average! Absolute madness.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
	</content>
